<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Casa Lista — Profesionales del hogar, a un clic</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg: #F7F5EF;
    --bg-alt: #EFECE2;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --ink: #1F3327;
    --ink-soft: #4E6157;
    --ink-faint: #8A9791;
    --accent: #B98A2E;
    --accent-dark: #8F6A20;
    --accent-soft: #EFDFB8;
    --line: #E2DDCE;
    --radius: 14px;
    --shadow: 0 8px 30px -12px rgba(31,51,39,0.18);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Manrope', sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}

  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  :focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset:2px;
  }

  .wrap{
    max-width:1180px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 28px;
  }

  /* ---------- Barra superior de accesos rápidos ---------- */
  .topbar{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#EDEFE9;
    font-size:0.82rem;
  }
  .topbar .wrap{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    height:38px;
  }
  .topbar-links{
    display:flex;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .topbar-links a{
    opacity:0.85;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    transition:opacity .15s;
  }
  .topbar-links a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .topbar-auth{
    display:flex;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .topbar-auth a{opacity:0.9;}
  .topbar-auth .btn-register-mini{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink);
    padding:5px 14px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-weight:700;
    opacity:1;
  }

  /* ---------- Cabecera principal ---------- */
  header.main{
    background:var(--surface);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:50;
  }
  .main-row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:28px;
    height:78px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:1.5rem;
    font-weight:600;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .logo .dot{color:var(--accent);}

  nav.main-nav{
    display:flex;
    gap:26px;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.95rem;
  }
  nav.main-nav a{
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    padding:6px 0;
    border-bottom:2px solid transparent;
    transition:color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  nav.main-nav a:hover{ color:var(--ink); border-color:var(--accent); }

  .searchbox{
    flex:1;
    max-width:380px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    background:var(--bg-alt);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:9px 16px;
    transition:border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .searchbox:focus-within{
    border-color:var(--accent);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft);
  }
  .searchbox input{
    border:none; background:transparent; outline:none;
    font-family:inherit; font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink); flex:1;
  }
  .searchbox input::placeholder{color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .searchbox svg{flex-shrink:0; color:var(--ink-faint);}

  .header-actions{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    margin-left:auto;
  }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:10px 20px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .12s, box-shadow .12s, background .15s;
  }
  .btn:active{transform:scale(0.97);}
  .btn-outline{
    border-color:var(--ink);
    color:var(--ink);
    background:transparent;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--ink); color:#fff;}
  .btn-solid{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .btn-solid:hover{ background:var(--accent-dark); }
  .btn-accent{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-accent:hover{ box-shadow:var(--shadow); }

  .burger{ display:none; }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    padding:76px 0 96px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-120px; right:-160px;
    width:480px; height:480px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 70%);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .hero .wrap{ position:relative; z-index:1; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:center; }
  .eyebrow{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--accent-dark);
    background:var(--accent-soft);
    padding:6px 14px; border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height:1.08;
    margin-bottom:20px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{ font-style:italic; color:var(--accent-dark); }
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size:1.08rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:480px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{ display:flex; gap:14px; margin-bottom:40px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .hero-stats{ display:flex; gap:36px; }
  .hero-stats div strong{ display:block; font-family:'Fraunces', serif; font-size:1.6rem; }
  .hero-stats div span{ font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-faint); }

  /* Buscador interactivo — elemento distintivo */
  .finder{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:26px;
  }
  .finder h3{ font-size:1.05rem; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .finder p{ color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .finder-chips{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .chip{
    padding:8px 14px;
    border-radius:999px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--bg-alt);
    font-size:0.85rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    transition:all .15s;
  }
  .chip:hover{ border-color:var(--accent); }
  .chip.active{
    background:var(--ink);
    border-color:var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
  }
  .finder-results{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }
  .finder-result{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
    padding:12px;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--bg-alt);
    font-size:0.87rem;
  }
  .finder-result .avatar{
    width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--accent-soft);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-weight:700; color:var(--accent-dark); flex-shrink:0; font-size:0.85rem;
  }
  .finder-result .meta strong{ display:block; }
  .finder-result .meta span{ color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.78rem; }
  .finder-result .rating{ margin-left:auto; font-weight:700; color:var(--accent-dark); white-space:nowrap; }

  /* ---------- Secciones generales ---------- */
  section{ padding:88px 0; }
  .section-head{ max-width:560px; margin-bottom:52px; }
  .section-head .eyebrow{ margin-bottom:14px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.4rem); margin-bottom:12px; }
  .section-head p{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:1.02rem; }

  .fade-in{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(18px); transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; }
  .fade-in.visible{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

  /* Servicios */
  .services-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:20px;
  }
  .service-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:26px;
    transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .18s, border-color .18s;
  }
  .service-card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    border-color:var(--accent-soft);
  }
  .service-card .icon{
    width:46px; height:46px;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--accent-soft);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:16px;
    color:var(--accent-dark);
  }
  .service-card h3{ font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .service-card p{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.88rem; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .service-card .price{ font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--accent-dark); }

  /* Cómo funciona */
  .steps{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:36px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .step{ position:relative; padding-left:0; }
  .step .num{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:2.4rem;
    color:var(--accent-soft);
    -webkit-text-stroke:1.5px var(--accent-dark);
    margin-bottom:14px;
    display:block;
  }
  .step h3{ font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .step p{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.92rem; }

  /* Testimonios */
  .testimonials{ background:var(--bg-alt); }
  .test-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px; }
  .test-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:26px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .test-card p{ font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:18px; font-style:italic; }
  .test-who{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }
  .test-who .avatar{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent-dark);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700; font-size:0.85rem;
  }
  .test-who strong{ display:block; font-size:0.88rem; }
  .test-who span{ font-size:0.76rem; color:var(--ink-faint); }

  /* CTA registro */
  .cta-band{
    background:var(--ink);
    color:#fff;
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:56px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:40px;
    margin:0 28px;
  }
  .cta-band h2{ color:#fff; font-size:1.9rem; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .cta-band p{ color:#C9D2CB; max-width:420px; }
  .cta-band .btn-accent{ white-space:nowrap; }

  /* Footer */
  footer{ padding:64px 0 32px; }
  .footer-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap:40px;
    margin-bottom:48px;
  }
  .footer-grid h4{ font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:16px; letter-spacing:0.03em; }
  .footer-grid ul li{ margin-bottom:10px; }
  .footer-grid ul li a{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.88rem; transition:color .15s; }
  .footer-grid ul li a:hover{ color:var(--accent-dark); }
  .footer-bottom{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:24px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    color:var(--ink-faint);
    font-size:0.82rem;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }

  /* ---------- Modal de acceso ---------- */
  .modal-overlay{
    position:fixed; inset:0;
    background:rgba(31,51,39,0.45);
    backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    display:none;
    align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    z-index:200;
    padding:20px;
  }
  .modal-overlay.open{ display:flex; }
  .modal{
    background:var(--surface);
    border-radius:20px;
    width:100%; max-width:400px;
    padding:32px;
    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    animation:pop .2s ease;
  }
  @keyframes pop{ from{ transform:scale(0.96); opacity:0; } to{ transform:scale(1); opacity:1; } }
  .modal-tabs{ display:flex; gap:6px; background:var(--bg-alt); border-radius:999px; padding:4px; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .modal-tabs button{
    flex:1; border:none; background:transparent; padding:9px 0; border-radius:999px;
    font-weight:700; font-size:0.86rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .modal-tabs button.active{ background:var(--ink); color:#fff; }
  .modal h3{ font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .modal .sub{ color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .field{ margin-bottom:14px; }
  .field label{ display:block; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px; color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .field input{
    width:100%; padding:11px 14px; border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid var(--line); font-family:inherit; font-size:0.92rem;
    background:var(--bg-alt); outline:none; transition:border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .field input:focus{ border-color:var(--accent); box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft); }
  .modal .btn{ width:100%; margin-top:8px; }
  .modal-close{
    position:absolute; top:18px; right:18px;
    width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:50%;
    border:none; background:var(--bg-alt); color:var(--ink-soft);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .modal{ position:relative; }
  .form-note{ font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-top:14px; text-align:center; }
  .form-success{
    display:none; text-align:center; padding:20px 0;
  }
  .form-success.show{ display:block; }
  .form-success .check{
    width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--accent-soft); color:var(--accent-dark);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 16px;
  }

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width: 980px){
    .hero .wrap{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .services-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); }
    .steps{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px; }
    .test-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .footer-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .cta-band{ flex-direction:column; text-align:center; margin:0 20px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px){
    nav.main-nav, .searchbox{ display:none; }
    .topbar-links{ display:none; }
    .burger{
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      width:40px; height:40px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; background:transparent;
      margin-right:4px;
    }
    .header-actions .btn-outline{ display:none; }
    .services-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .footer-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .hero{ padding:44px 0 60px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== Barra superior: accesos rápidos, inicio de sesión y registro ===== -->
<div class="topbar">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="topbar-links">
      <a href="#servicios">Explorar servicios</a>
      <a href="#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
      <a href="#ayuda">Ayuda</a>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-auth">
      <a href="#" id="openLogin">Iniciar sesión</a>
      <a href="#" id="openRegisterTop" class="btn-register-mini">Registrarme</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== Cabecera principal ===== -->
<header class="main">
  <div class="wrap main-row">
    <button class="burger" aria-label="Abrir menú">
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    </button>
    <a href="#" class="logo">Casa<span class="dot">·</span>Lista</a>

    <nav class="main-nav">
      <a href="#servicios">Servicios</a>
      <a href="#como-funciona">Cómo funciona</a>
      <a href="#profesionales">Profesionales</a>
      <a href="#opiniones">Opiniones</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="searchbox" role="search">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <input type="text" placeholder="Busca un servicio o profesional…">
    </div>

    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-outline" id="openLogin2">Iniciar sesión</button>
      <button class="btn btn-solid" id="openRegister2">Crear cuenta</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Bogotá y alrededores</span>
      <h1>Profesionales de confianza para <em>tu casa</em>, cuando los necesitas.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Encuentra plomeros, electricistas, personal de limpieza y mucho más — verificados, calificados por otros usuarios y listos para agendar hoy mismo.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <button class="btn btn-accent" id="openRegisterHero">Pedir un servicio</button>
        <a href="#como-funciona" class="btn btn-outline">Ver cómo funciona</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>12.400+</strong><span>Servicios completados</span></div>
        <div><strong>4.9 / 5</strong><span>Calificación promedio</span></div>
        <div><strong>850+</strong><span>Profesionales activos</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Buscador interactivo: elemento distintivo de la página -->
    <div class="finder">
      <h3>Encuentra ayuda ahora</h3>
      <p>Elige una categoría y mira profesionales disponibles cerca de ti.</p>
      <div class="finder-chips" id="chips">
        <button class="chip active" data-cat="todos">Todos</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="plomeria">Plomería</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="electricidad">Electricidad</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="limpieza">Limpieza</button>
        <button class="chip" data-cat="jardin">Jardín</button>
      </div>
      <div class="finder-results" id="results"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== Servicios ===== -->
<section id="servicios">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">Nuestro catálogo</span>
      <h2>Todo lo que tu hogar necesita</h2>
      <p>Selecciona una categoría, describe el trabajo y recibe propuestas de profesionales verificados en minutos.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3c-3 3-6 6.5-6 10a6 6 0 0012 0c0-3.5-3-7-6-10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Plomería</h3>
        <p>Fugas, instalaciones, destape de tuberías y reparaciones urgentes.</p>
        <span class="price">Desde $45.000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M13 2L4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Electricidad</h3>
        <p>Instalación de tomas, tableros, iluminación y diagnósticos de red.</p>
        <span class="price">Desde $50.000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 20l7-7M14 6l4 4M6 18l1.5-4.5L14 7l3 3-6.5 6.5L6 18z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Limpieza del hogar</h3>
        <p>Limpieza general, profunda o post-obra, con productos incluidos.</p>
        <span class="price">Desde $60.000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card fade-in">
        <div class="icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 22V12M12 12c-4 0-7-3-7-7 4 0 7 3 7 7zm0 0c4 0 7-3 7-7-4 0-7 3-7 7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Jardinería</h3>
        <p>Poda, siembra, mantenimiento de zonas verdes y riego automático.</p>
        <span class="price">Desde $40.000</span>
